The ReSTIR story's choice of a light by power
=============================================

What the story draws on the canvas (lab/src/math/) for chapter 3's beat `c3-params-power`, stage by stage as
its stage (`stepOf "params" 13`, the clips below) goes from 0 to 11: the math scenes' example world's 24 lights
(examples.rs, the lab's illustration), each one's share of the power laid end to end (1); the alias table built from
those shares (Vose's method, alias.rs, the table the lab's own lights are drawn from too): its columns, each as tall
as the average share (2), each light's part in its own column (3), then the gaps filled in the order the table fills them
(`exampleFillOrder`): the first light over the average giving to one gap after another (4), its own column's gap
filled by the next (5), and the rest (6); one column's own light and alias (7); one draw from it, a column (8) and
then a part (9), and the light it lands on (10); a uniform point on the drawn triangle (11); the lab's sphere for the
same draw (12); and the alias table's pieces gathered again, as long as the shares they came from (13).

$[Import* std]
$[Import* render_lab_runtime]
$[Import* render_lab_math]
$[Import* paper_restir_values]
$[Import* paper_restir_natives]
$[Import* paper_restir_common]

The layout

The seed of the draw's two uniform numbers.
$[# _seed 5]
The strip of shares: its ends, and its bottom and top.
$[# _x0 -6.6]
$[# _x1 6.6]
$[# _stripLo 2.6]
$[# _stripHi 3.0]
The alias table: its left edge, a column's width, its bottom, and a column's height (the average share).
$[# _tableX -6.6]
$[# _colW 0.25]
$[# _tableY -2.2]
$[# _tableH 3.0]
The right of the canvas: the triangle, then the sphere.
$[# _shapeAt [% {v2 4.5 -0.7}]]

Fn([Float, Float, Float, Float], Box). A span of the shares (its start and length, of the whole) on a strip from
`lo` to `hi`.
$[# {_onStrip start length lo hi} {box
    {v2 {lerp _x0 _x1 start} lo}
    {v2 {lerp _x0 _x1 {+ start length}} hi}}]

Fn([Int, Float, Float], Box). Column `c` of the alias table from `lo` to `hi` (a column is 1 high).
$[# {_inColumn c lo hi}
    [# x {+ _tableX {* _colW {float c}}}]
    {box
        {v2 {+ x 0.02} {+ _tableY {* _tableH lo}}}
        {v2 {- {+ x _colW} 0.02} {+ _tableY {* _tableH hi}}}}]

Fn([Box, Box, Float], Box). A box on its way from `a` to `b`.
$[# {_between a b k} {box {lerp2 {.lo a} {.lo b} k} {lerp2 {.hi a} {.hi b} k}}]

The alias table

Fn([String, List({column: Int, hi: Float, length: Float, light: Int, lo: Float, start: Float}), List(String), Float, Float, Float], List(Mob)).
The table's pieces, each on its way (at `t`, each light's after the one before) from its place among the shares on
a strip from `lo` to `hi` into its column, or back (`back`).
$[# {_pieces id pieces colors t lo hi back} {flatten {map
    {zip {range 0 {length pieces}} pieces}
    {^ {e}
        [# p {.second e}]
        [# k {smooth {lagged t {.light p} {length colors} 0.3}}]
        [# strip {_onStrip {.start p} {.length p} lo hi}]
        [# column {_inColumn {.column p} {.lo p} {.hi p}}]
        {filled
            {++ id {++ "." {str {.first e}}}}
            {!if {> back 0.5} {_between column strip k} {_between strip column k}}
            {nth colors {.light p}}
            0.9}}}}]

Fn([List({alias: Int, own: Float}), Float, Float], List(Mob)). One draw from the table at `t`: the first number
picks a column, the second a part of it, its own light's or its alias's; its numbers at opacity `shown`.
$[# {_draw alias t shown}
    [# u1 {uniform _seed 0}]
    [# u2 {uniform _seed 1}]
    [# n {length alias}]
    [# c {min {- n 1} {floor {* u1 {float n}}}}]
    [# own {.own {nth alias c}}]
    [# isOwn {< u2 own}]
    [# cx {+ _tableX {* _colW {+ {float c} 0.5}}}]
    [# uy {+ _tableY {* _tableH u2}}]
    [# column {fadeIn
        {phase t 0.0 0.2}
        {append
            {arrowLine "column" {v2 cx 1.3} {v2 cx {+ 0.1 {+ _tableY _tableH}}} accentColor 3.0}
            {faded
                {moveTo
                    {tex "u1" f"{\lceil ${str n}\,u_1 \rceil = ${str {+ c 1}}}" 0.4 textColor}
                    {v2 -5.0 1.7}}
                shown}}}]
    [# part {fadeIn
        {phase t 0.4 0.6}
        {flatten {'
            {line "u2" {v2 {- cx 0.3} uy} {v2 {+ cx 0.3} uy} accentColor 3.0}
            {faded
                {moveTo
                    {tex "u2" f"{u_2 = ${numberLatex u2 2} ${!if isOwn "<" f"{\geq}"} ${numberLatex own 2}}" 0.4
                        textColor}
                    {v2 -1.9 1.7}}
                shown}}}}]
    [# chosen {create
        {phase t 0.7 1.0}
        {outlined "chosen"
            {padded {!if isOwn {_inColumn c 0.0 own} {_inColumn c own 1.0}} 0.04}
            accentColor
            3.0}}]
    {flatten {' column part chosen}}]

Fn([List({alias: Int, own: Float})], Int). The column the draw's first number picks.
$[# {_column alias} {min {- {length alias} 1} {floor {* {uniform _seed 0} {float {length alias}}}}}]

Fn([List({alias: Int, own: Float})], Int). The light the draw picks.
$[# {_drawn alias}
    [# c {_column alias}]
    {!if {< {uniform _seed 1} {.own {nth alias c}}} c {.alias {nth alias c}}}]

Fn([Int, Float], List(Mob)). The empty columns at `t`, one for each of `n` lights, each as tall as the average
share.
$[# {_frames n t} {fadeIn t {flatten {map
    {range 0 n}
    {^ {c} {outlined {++ "frame" {str c}} {_inColumn c 0.0 1.0} textDimColor 1.5}}}}}]

Fn([List({alias: Int, own: Float}), Float], List(Mob)). Column `c` of the table (the one the draw picks) outlined
at `t`, its two parts named: the column's own light, below, and its alias, above.
$[# {_twoParts alias t}
    [# c {_column alias}]
    [# own {.own {nth alias c}}]
    [# cx {+ _tableX {* _colW {+ {float c} 1.0}}}]
    [# label {^ {id name lo hi}
        [# y {+ _tableY {* _tableH {* 0.5 {+ lo hi}}}}]
        {append
            {arrowLine {++ id "Arrow"} {v2 0.0 y} {v2 {+ cx 0.08} y} accentColor 2.5}
            {moveTo name {v2 1.6 y}}}}]
    {fadeIn t {flatten {'
        {outlined "twoParts" {padded {_inColumn c 0.0 1.0} 0.04} accentColor 3.0}
        {label "ownLabel" {caption "ownLabel" {textKey "paramsmath-own"} 0.32 textColor} 0.0 own}
        {label "aliasLabel"
            {caption "aliasLabel" {textKey "paramsmath-its-alias"} 0.32 textColor}
            own
            1.0}}}}]

The shapes

Fn([Float, Color], List(Mob)). The drawn light's triangle at `t`, and uniform points on it (the square root
spreads them evenly), the last one lit.
$[# {_triangle t color}
    [# a {add2 _shapeAt {v2 -1.6 -1.3}}]
    [# b {add2 _shapeAt {v2 1.6 -1.1}}]
    [# c {add2 _shapeAt {v2 0.0 1.3}}]
    [# n 60]
    [# points {map
        {range 0 n}
        {^ {i}
            [# r {sqrt {uniform 11 i}}]
            [# v {uniform 29 i}]
            {add2 {add2 {scale2 a {- 1.0 r}} {scale2 b {* r {- 1.0 v}}}} {scale2 c {* r v}}}}}]
    {flatten {'
        {create {phase t 0.0 0.3} {pathThrough "triangle" {' a b c a} color 3.0}}
        {flatten {map
            {range 0 n}
            {^ {i} {fadeIn
                {lagged {phase t 0.3 0.8} i n 0.1}
                {dotAt {++ "point" {str i}} {nth points i} 0.04 textDimColor}}}}}
        {fadeIn {phase t 0.8 1.0} {dotAt "pointLit" {nth points {- n 1}} 0.09 accentColor}}
        {fadeIn
            {phase t 0.3 0.6}
            {moveTo
                {caption "triangleNote" {textKey "paramsmath-triangle"} 0.32 textDimColor}
                {v2 {.x _shapeAt} -2.65}}}}}]

Fn([Float, Color], List(Mob)). The drawn light's sphere at `t`, as its outline, and a point on it.
$[# {_sphere t color}
    [# circle {map
        {range 0 49}
        {^ {i} {add2 _shapeAt {scale2
            {v2 {cos {* 0.1308997 {float i}}} {sin {* 0.1308997 {float i}}}}
            1.3}}}}]
    {flatten {'
        {create t {pathThrough "sphere" circle color 3.0}}
        {fadeIn
            {phase t 0.6 1.0}
            {dotAt "spherePoint"
                {add2 _shapeAt {scale2 {v2 {cos 2.2} {sin 2.2}} 1.3}}
                0.09
                accentColor}}
        {fadeIn
            {phase t 0.3 0.8}
            {moveTo
                {caption "sphereNote" {textKey "paramsmath-sphere"} 0.32 textDimColor}
                {v2 {.x _shapeAt} -2.65}}}}}]

The scene

Fn([String, List({column: Int, hi: Float, length: Float, light: Int, lo: Float, start: Float}), List(Int), List(Color), Float], List(Mob)).
The gaps of the columns `cols` filled in turn at `t`, each by its alias's piece, from the piece's place among the
shares into its column.
$[# {_fills id tops cols colors t} {flatten {map
    {zip {range 0 {length cols}} cols}
    {^ {e}
        [# p {nth {filter tops {^ {q} {= {.column q} {.second e}}}} 0}]
        [# k {smooth {lagged t {.first e} {length cols} 0.3}}]
        {filled
            {++ id {++ "." {str {.first e}}}}
            {_between
                {_onStrip {.start p} {.length p} _stripLo _stripHi}
                {_inColumn {.column p} {.lo p} {.hi p}}
                k}
            {nth colors {.light p}}
            0.9}}}}]

Fn([Float], List(Mob)). The scene at stage s.
$[# {_scene s}
    [# shares {map {exampleLights 0 0.0 1.0} .share}]
    [# colors {spectrum {length shares}}]
    [# starts {runningSums shares}]
    [# alias {exampleAlias}]
    [# pieces {examplePieces}]
    [# own {filter pieces {^ {p} {= {.column p} {.light p}}}}]
    [# tops {filter pieces {^ {p} {not {= {.column p} {.light p}}}}}]
    [# order {exampleFillOrder}]
    [# n {length order}]
    [# donor {.alias {nth alias {nth order 0}}}]
    [# drops {fold {range 0 n} n {^ {m i} {!if {= {nth order i} donor} {min m i} m}}}]
    [# first {map {range 0 drops} {^ {i} {nth order i}}}]
    [# refill {map {range drops {min n {+ drops 1}}} {^ {i} {nth order i}}}]
    [# rest {map {range {min n {+ drops 1}} n} {^ {i} {nth order i}}}]
    [# drawn {_drawn alias}]
    [# strip {growFrom
        {phase s 0.0 0.8}
        {flatten {strip "shares" shares {box {v2 _x0 _stripLo} {v2 _x1 _stripHi}} colors 0.0}}
        left}]
    [# sharesNote {moveTo
        {caption "sharesNote" {textKey "paramsmath-shares"} 0.32 textDimColor}
        {v2 0.0 3.45}}]
    [# aliasNote {moveTo
        {caption "aliasNote" {textKey "paramsmath-alias"} 0.32 textDimColor}
        {v2 {+ _tableX {* _colW 12.0}} -2.65}}]
    [# table {flatten {'
        {_pieces "own" own colors {phase s 2.0 2.9} _stripLo _stripHi 0.0}
        {!if {< s 3.0} {'} {_fills "first" tops first colors {phase s 3.0 3.9}}}
        {!if {< s 4.2} {'} {_fills "refill" tops refill colors {phase s 4.2 4.9}}}
        {!if {< s 5.0} {'} {_fills "rest" tops rest colors {phase s 5.0 5.9}}}
        {fadeIn {phase s 1.4 1.9} aliasNote}}}]
    [# donorMarks {append
        {fadeIn
            {phase s 3.0 3.3}
            {outlined "donor"
                {_onStrip {nth starts donor} {nth shares donor} {- _stripLo 0.1} {+ _stripHi 0.1}}
                accentColor
                3.0}}
        {fadeIn
            {phase s 4.0 4.3}
            {outlined "donorColumn" {padded {_inColumn donor 0.0 1.0} 0.04} accentColor 3.0}}}]
    [# dim {- 1.0 {* 0.65 {smooth {phase s 12.0 12.2}}}}]
    [# leaving {smooth {phase s 12.0 12.15}}]
    [# landed {outlined "landed"
        {_onStrip {nth starts drawn} {nth shares drawn} {- _stripLo 0.1} {+ _stripHi 0.1}}
        accentColor
        3.0}]
    {flatten {'
        strip
        {fadeIn {phase s 0.0 0.3} sharesNote}
        {!if {< s 1.0}
            {'}
            {faded
                {_frames {length shares} {phase s 1.0 1.6}}
                {* dim {- 1.0 {* 0.6 {smooth {phase s 6.0 6.3}}}}}}}
        {!if {!or {< s 1.0} {> s 6.3}}
            {'}
            {fadeOut
                {phase s 6.0 6.3}
                {fadeIn
                    {phase s 1.4 2.0}
                    {moveTo
                        {caption "averageNote" {textKey "paramsmath-average"} 0.32 textDimColor}
                        {v2 2.8 {+ _tableY _tableH}}}}}}
        {!if {< s 2.0} {'} {faded table dim}}
        {!if {!or {< s 3.0} {> s 5.0}} {'} {fadeOut {phase s 4.8 5.0} donorMarks}}
        {!if {!or {< s 6.0} {> s 8.0}}
            {'}
            {fadeOut {phase s 7.7 8.0} {_twoParts alias {phase s 6.0 6.4}}}}
        {!if {!or {< s 7.0} {> s 12.15}}
            {'}
            {faded
                {_draw alias {+ {* 0.35 {phase s 7.0 8.0}} {* 0.65 {phase s 8.0 9.0}}} 1.0}
                {- 1.0 leaving}}}
        {!if {!or {< s 9.0} {> s 12.15}}
            {'}
            {faded {fadeIn {phase s 9.0 9.4} landed} {- 1.0 leaving}}}
        {!if {!or {< s 10.0} {> s 11.2}}
            {'}
            {fadeOut {phase s 11.0 11.2} {_triangle {phase s 10.0 11.0} {nth colors drawn}}}}
        {!if {!or {< s 11.1} {> s 12.15}}
            {'}
            {faded {_sphere {phase s 11.1 11.4} {nth colors drawn}} {- 1.0 leaving}}}
        {!if {< s 12.1} {'} {_pieces "gather" pieces colors {phase s 12.1 12.8} 1.95 2.35 1.0}}
        {!if {< s 12.6}
            {'}
            {fadeIn
                {phase s 12.6 12.9}
                {moveTo
                    {caption "sameNote" {textKey "paramsmath-same"} 0.32 textDimColor}
                    {v2 0.0 1.55}}}}}}]

The hook

Fn([Float], List(Mob)). The choice of a light by power at stage its stage (`stepOf "params" 13`, the clips below).
$[# paramsMath {: {^ {t} {_scene {stepOf "params" 13}}} Math}]

Clips

The scene's steps as clips (lab/src/clip.rs): its demonstration's Play plays every step in order, a second each;
the story plays each over its sentence's words, and sets the scene back to a step where a beat starts.
$[# paramsSteps [% {stepsInOrder "params" 13}]]
$[# paramsAt0 [% {stepsAt "params" 13 0}]]
$[# paramsStep1 [% {stepClip "params" 1 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# paramsStep2 [% {stepClip "params" 2 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# paramsStep3 [% {stepClip "params" 3 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# paramsStep4 [% {stepClip "params" 4 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# paramsStep5 [% {stepClip "params" 5 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# paramsStep6 [% {stepClip "params" 6 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# paramsStep7 [% {stepClip "params" 7 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# paramsStep8 [% {stepClip "params" 8 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# paramsStep9 [% {stepClip "params" 9 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# paramsStep10 [% {stepClip "params" 10 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# paramsStep11 [% {stepClip "params" 11 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# paramsStep12 [% {stepClip "params" 12 0.0 1.0}]]
$[# paramsStep13 [% {stepClip "params" 13 0.0 1.0}]]
